  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d2a9460aae1c4420a415466d1db880f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 23
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dossamer.Dialogue.Schema.Cutscene
  Title: 2-3
  Exchanges:
  - Lines:
    - Text: Hello? Is anyone else around? This office seems to be empty...
      Guid:
        Value: b26b83b9-665e-4c55-b370-7595989a17ad
    - Text: Kinda creepy, it's not helping that I am one of the only humans working
        at AHS, now I gotta be reminded of that as well?
      Guid:
        Value: 9e67b18c-2f00-4077-8498-73ad7ffe7476
    - Text: Anyway, I am not paid to answer these questions, I'd need another 5%
        pay increase for that, I have some dignity after all.
      Guid:
        Value: ca56e612-0d10-4ee6-bd7a-aa040bb6b930
    - Text: '[SOME OF THE CUBICLES ON THIS LEVEL HAVE RAILS ON TOP OF THEM. JUMP
        ON TOP OF THEM TO START GRINDING]'
      Guid:
        Value: e1a0c430-62f6-4d55-a5b8-cf2df0e11db0
    Speaker: The Janitor
    Guid:
      Value: 1ff1ee7b-aa22-4d94-8b1d-d1e1d1413361
  Guid:
    Value: e42bfac2-5459-41c4-9796-bc5c33e6d99c
